OL,3,GNEWSANew forensic nurses to help
OL,4,Avictims of rape and sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpecially-trained nurses will now be
OL,7,Fable to carry out examinations on
OL,8,Fvictims of sexual assault to help
OL,9,Fgather evidence of crime.
OL,11,FPreviously, only doctors could gather
OL,12,Fforensic evidence that could be used in
OL,13,FScottish courts. This caused issues
OL,14,Fincluding delays due to a shortage of
OL,15,Fqualified medics, having to travel to
OL,16,Fbe assessed, and limited access to
OL,17,Ffemale doctors.
