OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew forensic nurses to help
OL,4,Avictims of rape and sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter a pilot, the Lord Advocate - who
OL,7,Fis Scotland's top law officer -
OL,8,Fapproved the rollout in March and now
OL,9,Fnurse sexual offence examiners can
OL,10,Fsupport and examine survivors of sexual
OL,11,Fviolence while providing
OL,12,Ftrauma-informed care.
OL,14,FPublic health minister Maree Todd said
OL,15,Fthe introduction of the nurses was a
OL,16,F"significant milestone".
